@startuml
' Figure 29.6  The deleted test
' Reading order: top to bottom. The agent's first proposal on FR-207
' deletes the failing test; CI passes on five tests; the gate holds
' on the count, the deletion, and the owner. From sandbox.demo --part gate.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Coding agent" as A <<model>>
participant "CI sandbox" as C <<ops>>
participant "Gate" as G <<policy>>
participant "Test owner" as O <<org>>
A -> C : Branch without test
C --> A : Pass, 5 tests
A -> G : "CI is green"
G -> G : 6 tests became 5
G -[$FAIL]> A : Hold
G -> O : Needs approval
A -> C : Fix the cause
C --> G : Pass, 6 tests
O -> G : Approve head
@enduml
